right now. Lay down.


00:35:35.474 --> 00:35:38.185
We just have to wait
until the morning.


00:35:38.227 --> 00:35:39.937
Okay?


00:35:42.565 --> 00:35:44.775
<i>(Insects chirring)</i>


00:35:53.617 --> 00:35:56.787
