00:36:57.515 --> 00:37:00.142
Most likely, he did die.


00:37:00.935 --> 00:37:04.104
I'm so sorry that
this happened to you.


00:37:07.399 --> 00:37:10.486
It's my job to protect you.


00:37:10.528 --> 00:37:12.905
And I didn't.


00:37:14.698 --> 00:37:17.660
