00:54:38.408 --> 00:54:40.618
<i>(Breathing shakily)</i>


00:54:46.082 --> 00:54:49.002
<i>(Quietly)</i> I'm so worried
about you.


00:54:53.923 --> 00:54:56.301
I don't know what to do.


00:55:01.264 --> 00:55:04.100
<i>(Liquid trickling)</i>


